  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NPM-Wezesha project &#x2013; capacity building in leadership and management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at addressing different aspects of women leadership in the PCU Churches. While there are few theological or structural hindrances for women in leadership in PCU, there are still socio-cultural norms that PCU wants to see challenged and changed. In the participation of the leadership and management training, affirmative action will be taken to ensure women participation.</narrative>
  </description>
